{"seq":3,"slug":"unidirectional-data-flow","title":"单向数据流架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/foundations/unidirectional-data-flow","wordCount":1194,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"单向数据流架构\">单向数据流架构</h1><p>当一个 MVVM 应用成长到拥有 30+ 个 ViewModel、每个 ViewModel 内部维护 5-10 个 MutableStateFlow 时，一个根本性问题浮现：<strong>你无法确定当前屏幕状态是怎么到达的。</strong> 多个异步操作并发修改状态，调试时重现同一个 bug 可能需要精确复现用户的操作序列。单向数据流（Unidirectional Data Flow, UDF）架构通过将状态变更收束为一条单行道来解决这个问题：<code>View → Intent → Reducer → State → View</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>单一状态对象</strong>：整个屏幕的 UI 状态用一个不可变 data class 表达，任何时刻都是一个完整快照</li>\n<li><strong>纯函数 Reducer</strong>：状态转换是纯函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>E</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(State, Action) \\rightarrow (State&#x27;, Effects)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0019em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，给定相同输入永远产出相同输出</li>\n<li><strong>受控副作用</strong>：I/O 操作不在 Reducer 中执行，而是由 Effect Handler 负责，其生命周期被 Scope 管理</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"核心模型-状态机\">核心模型：状态机</h2><p>单向数据流的数学本质是一个<strong>有限状态机</strong>（FSM），其转换函数是纯函数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>reduce</mtext><mo>:</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>Action</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>Effect</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{reduce}: (S_{current}, \\text{Action}) \\rightarrow (S_{next}, [\\text{Effect}])</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">reduce</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Action</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Effect</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">])</span></span></span></span></span></div><ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 是不可变状态</li>\n<li>Action 是用户操作或系统事件的枚举</li>\n<li>Effect 是需要与外部世界交互的副作用（网络请求、导航、Toast）</li>\n<li>整个函数是<strong>纯的</strong>——给定相同的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{current}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 Action，永远返回相同的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{next}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>这个模型的直接收益：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>可重现</strong>：记录 Action 序列即可重放任意状态</li>\n<li><strong>可测试</strong>：Reducer 是纯函数，无需 mock 任何外部依赖</li>\n<li><strong>可调试</strong>：Time-travel debugging——在 Action 历史中前后滑动查看状态变化</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    V[View] --&gt;|用户操作| I[Intent/Action]&#10;    I --&gt; R[Reducer&lt;br/&gt;纯函数]&#10;    R --&gt;|新 State| S[State Store]&#10;    S --&gt;|订阅| V&#10;    R --&gt;|Effect| E[Effect Handler&lt;br/&gt;副作用执行器]&#10;    E --&gt;|结果 Action| I\">flowchart LR\n    V[View] --&gt;|用户操作| I[Intent/Action]\n    I --&gt; R[Reducer&lt;br/&gt;纯函数]\n    R --&gt;|新 State| S[State Store]\n    S --&gt;|订阅| V\n    R --&gt;|Effect| E[Effect Handler&lt;br/&gt;副作用执行器]\n    E --&gt;|结果 Action| I</pre><h2 id=\"与-mvvm-的关键差异\">与 MVVM 的关键差异</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>MVVM（多 Flow）</th>\n<th>UDF（单一 State）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>状态表示</td>\n<td>多个独立 StateFlow</td>\n<td>一个不可变 data class</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态变更入口</td>\n<td>ViewModel 的多个公开方法</td>\n<td>唯一的 <code>dispatch(action)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>副作用触发</td>\n<td>分散在 ViewModel 各方法中</td>\n<td>集中在 Effect Handler</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中间状态</td>\n<td>可能存在（多 Flow 更新顺序不确定）</td>\n<td>不存在（原子替换整个 State）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调试</td>\n<td>断点 + log</td>\n<td>断点 + log + Action 回放</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键洞察：UDF 不是否定 MVVM，而是在 MVVM 之上增加了<strong>状态变更的唯一路径约束</strong>。Google 在 2024 年更新的 Architecture Guide 中将 UDF 作为推荐实践，同时保留 ViewModel 作为状态持有者——两者并不矛盾。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨平台实现对照\">跨平台实现对照</h2><h3 id=\"android-viewmodel-sealed-intent\">Android：ViewModel + sealed Intent</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// State&#10;data class SearchState(&#10;    val query: String = &quot;&quot;,&#10;    val results: List&lt;Product&gt; = emptyList(),&#10;    val isLoading: Boolean = false,&#10;    val error: String? = null&#10;)&#10;&#10;// Intent（用户意图）&#10;sealed interface SearchIntent {&#10;    data class QueryChanged(val text: String) : SearchIntent&#10;    data object Search : SearchIntent&#10;    data class ResultClicked(val productId: String) : SearchIntent&#10;}&#10;&#10;// ViewModel 作为 Store&#10;class SearchViewModel(&#10;    private val searchUseCase: SearchProductsUseCase&#10;) : ViewModel() {&#10;&#10;    private val _state = MutableStateFlow(SearchState())&#10;    val state: StateFlow&lt;SearchState&gt; = _state.asStateFlow()&#10;&#10;    fun dispatch(intent: SearchIntent) {&#10;        when (intent) {&#10;            is SearchIntent.QueryChanged -&gt; reduce { copy(query = intent.text) }&#10;            is SearchIntent.Search -&gt; executeSearch()&#10;            is SearchIntent.ResultClicked -&gt; navigateToDetail(intent.productId)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private fun reduce(block: SearchState.() -&gt; SearchState) {&#10;        _state.update(block)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private fun executeSearch() {&#10;        viewModelScope.launch {&#10;            reduce { copy(isLoading = true, error = null) }&#10;            searchUseCase(state.value.query)&#10;                .onSuccess { results -&gt; reduce { copy(isLoading = false, results = results) } }&#10;                .onFailure { e -&gt; reduce { copy(isLoading = false, error = e.message) } }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// State</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data class SearchState(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val query: String = \"\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val results: List&#x3C;Product> = emptyList(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val isLoading: Boolean = false,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val error: String? = null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Intent（用户意图）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sealed interface SearchIntent {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data class QueryChanged(val text: String) : SearchIntent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data object Search : SearchIntent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data class ResultClicked(val productId: String) : SearchIntent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ViewModel 作为 Store</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class SearchViewModel(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val searchUseCase: SearchProductsUseCase</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) : ViewModel() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val _state = MutableStateFlow(SearchState())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val state: StateFlow&#x3C;SearchState> = _state.asStateFlow()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun dispatch(intent: SearchIntent) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        when (intent) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            is SearchIntent.QueryChanged -> reduce { copy(query = intent.text) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            is SearchIntent.Search -> executeSearch()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            is SearchIntent.ResultClicked -> navigateToDetail(intent.productId)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private fun reduce(block: SearchState.() -> SearchState) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _state.update(block)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private fun executeSearch() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        viewModelScope.launch {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            reduce { copy(isLoading = true, error = null) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            searchUseCase(state.value.query)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .onSuccess { results -> reduce { copy(isLoading = false, results = results) } }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .onFailure { e -> reduce { copy(isLoading = false, error = e.message) } }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"ios-swift-combine-async-实现\">iOS：Swift Combine/async 实现</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// State&#10;struct SearchState: Equatable {&#10;    var query: String = &quot;&quot;&#10;    var results: [Product] = []&#10;    var isLoading: Bool = false&#10;    var error: String?&#10;}&#10;&#10;// Action&#10;enum SearchAction: Equatable {&#10;    case queryChanged(String)&#10;    case search&#10;    case searchResponse(Result&lt;[Product], Error&gt;)&#10;}&#10;&#10;// Reducer（纯函数）&#10;func searchReducer(state: inout SearchState, action: SearchAction) -&gt; Effect&lt;SearchAction&gt; {&#10;    switch action {&#10;    case .queryChanged(let text):&#10;        state.query = text&#10;        return .none&#10;&#10;    case .search:&#10;        state.isLoading = true&#10;        state.error = nil&#10;        return .run { [query = state.query] send in&#10;            let result = await searchProducts(query: query)&#10;            await send(.searchResponse(result))&#10;        }&#10;&#10;    case .searchResponse(.success(let products)):&#10;        state.isLoading = false&#10;        state.results = products&#10;        return .none&#10;&#10;    case .searchResponse(.failure(let error)):&#10;        state.isLoading = false&#10;        state.error = error.localizedDescription&#10;        return .none&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// State</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SearchState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Equatable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span c